<h2>Quick Tagger</h2>

<p>This tool just selects a random post with the "tagme" tag. Help out if you have a spare moment! If you think a post is fully tagged after you've added any extra info, just remove the tagme tag.</p>

<div class="tagger__container">
  <%= turbo_frame_tag @post, src: post_url(@post) %>

  <div class="upload-edit-container">
    <%= render 'posts/partials/show/edit', post: @post, for_tagger: true %>
  </div>
</div>
